## Cold forges

@narrator{code="0010"}: Every forge in town is cold. Every one but the last.
@bram{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: CUSTOMERS! Finally! Sit! Sharpen! Doris hasn't had a visitor in a month!
@aria{code="0010"}: Why is your forge the only one burning?
@bram{code="0020" emotion="sad"}: Because I don't let it go out. Not for a second. Not since the dark came.
